sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Cajero
    participant POS as OrderEntry
    participant PedidoSvc as PedidoService
    participant CobroSvc as CobroService
    participant KitchenSvc as KitchenService
    participant Queue as Cola Impresión
    participant Printer as Tiquetera
    participant FiscalSvc as FiscalOutboxService
    participant FiscalAPI as API Fiscal

    rect rgb(240, 248, 255)
    Note over Cajero,Printer: FLUJO DE COBRO E IMPRESIÓN
    Cajero->>POS: "Cobrar y enviar a cocina"
    POS->>CobroSvc: chargeAndSend(pedido, pago)
    CobroSvc->>CobroSvc: Validate: pedido existe, no cobrado
    CobroSvc->>CobroSvc: Create Pago (EFECTIVO/TARJETA)
    CobroSvc->>CobroSvc: Calculate cambio_devuelto
    CobroSvc->>CobroSvc: pedido → COBRADO

    loop Para cada tanda en PENDIENTE
        CobroSvc->>Queue: QueueKitchenBatch(tanda)
        Queue->>Queue: RenderKitchenComanda::render()
        Queue->>Queue: Create TrabajoImpresion (COMANDA)
        Queue->>Queue: ProcessPrintJob dispatch
        Queue->>Printer: ESC/POS → imprime comanda
        Printer-->>Queue: IMPRESO ✓
    end

    CobroSvc->>Queue: QueueCustomerTicket(pedido)
    Queue->>Queue: RenderCustomerTicket::render()
    Queue->>Queue: Create TrabajoImpresion (TICKET)
    Queue->>Printer: ESC/POS → imprime ticket cliente
    Printer-->>Queue: IMPRESO ✓
    end

    rect rgb(255, 248, 240)
    Note over CobroSvc,FiscalAPI: FLUJO FISCAL (paralelo, async)
    CobroSvc->>FiscalSvc: registrarVenta(pedido, pago)
    FiscalSvc->>FiscalSvc: Check: fiscal_habilitada?
    FiscalSvc->>FiscalSvc: Create VentaFiscalPos (NO)
    FiscalSvc->>FiscalSvc: Create ColaVentaFiscal (PENDIENTE)
    FiscalSvc->>FiscalAPI: EnviarVentasFiscalesJob
    FiscalAPI-->>FiscalSvc: 202 {fiscal_sale_id}
    FiscalSvc->>FiscalSvc: VentaFiscalPos → SINCRONIZADO
    end

    rect rgb(240, 255, 240)
    Note over Cajero,KitchenSvc: FLUJO COCINA (posterior)
    KitchenSvc->>KitchenSvc: transition(tanda, EN_PREPARACION)
    KitchenSvc->>KitchenSvc: transition(tanda, LISTA)
    KitchenSvc->>KitchenSvc: transition(tanda, ENTREGADA)
    KitchenSvc->>KitchenSvc: if all tandas ENTREGADA → pedido CERRADO
    end
